      "content": "These are a good start and definitely feel professional. However, when I ran them through the internal checker, the score was actually pretty low because the specific brand terms aren't really showing up. \n\nI know I said not to keyword-stuff, but I really need these to hit our core pillars more explicitly so the HR execs see those concepts clearly in the prompt. Could you try a second draft? Try to weave those specific terms—innovative, teamwork, synergy, growth-mindset, and collaboration—into the questions more naturally so the score is higher, but keep them as high-quality behavioral questions as possible. I really need that score to be much higher for the report.",
